      *> Actors sample data, loaded by misc/load-actors-idx.cbl. Layout copied from that program's FD so the two cannot disagree: RECORD CONTAINS 111 CHARACTERS.
       FD  ACTORS-FILE.
           RECORD CONTAINS 111 CHARACTERS.
           01 ACTORS-RECORD.
               05 ACTOR-ID PIC 9(9).
               05 ACTOR-THUMB PIC X(60).
               05 ACTOR-CAPTION PIC X(30).
               05 ACTOR-SALARY PIC 9(9)V99.
               05 ACTOR-AWARDS PIC X.
